<title>USA: AmeriPath expands contract with SmithKline.</title>
<headline>AmeriPath expands contract with SmithKline.</headline>
<dateline>RIVIERA BEACH, Fla. 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>AmeriPath Inc said Wednesday it expanded its existing contract with SmithKline Beecham Clinical Laboratories from five to more than 20 counties.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Through its division, Derrick &amp; Associates Pathology, AmeriPath will provide anatomic pathology services to SmithKline.</p>
<p>SmithKline Beecham Clinical Laboratories is a division of SmithKline Beecham PLC.</p>
<p>AmeriPath is a private company.</p>
</text>
